    <string name="dialog_eula_message">NGA WHAKAMAHI KAUPAPA ME TE WHAKAMAHI WHAKAMAHI WHAKAMAHI WHAKAMAHI (EULA)\n\n1. TE WHAKAMAHI KAUPAPA &amp; WHAKAMAHI\nHe puna tuwhera tenei kaupapa engari ma te Mana pupuri. Ka whakaaetia koe ki te tohatoha me te whakarereke i tenei rorohiko mena ka hoatu he nama marama ki te kaihanga taketake.\n© zMykerd. Katoa nga mana.\n\n2. TE WHAKAMAHI ME TE WHAKAMAHI I TE TURE\nI hangaia tenei rorohiko hei taputapu haumaru whaiaro/SOS. Ka tino whakaae koe KAUA e whakamahi i tenei tono, i tana waehere puna, i etahi tuhinga e pa ana mo nga kaupapa ture, te tirotiro kore mana, me nga mahi torotoro. Karekau he kawenga a te Kaihanga mo te whakamahi hee!\n\nMa te panui "Whakaae", ka whakaae koe ki enei tikanga. Ki te kore koe e whakaae, kowhiria te "DECLINE" ki te puta atu i te tono.</string>
